 "diagnosis": "The loop invariant res == sum(a,i,j) - sum(a,i,ind+1) lacks bounds on ind. Without ind+1 <= j (and ind+1 >= i), the call sum(a,i,ind+1) violates sum's precondition. Without ind >= i-1, the loop exit condition ind < i does not imply ind == i-1, so the invariant plus the negated guard cannot establish res == sum(a,i,j). Adding the invariant i-1 <= ind <= j-1 fixes both problems."}

